[{"code":"not_implemented","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":18,"col":63},"end":{"line":18,"col":67}},"title":"NOT IMPLEMENTED YET","message":"A limit of the compiler: `browser-inline` compiles a `view` whose body is markup\nwritten in place, after any `let`s, and this one's computes its markup — an\n`if`, a `case` or a call — which it does not compile yet\n(`docs/design/browser-inline.md` §8.2; §5, class 1). Write the markup in place\nas the body of `view`, with the choice in a hole, or build this program with\n`--platform=browser-tea`."}]
